    "agendaChanges": "At the start of the meeting, Trustee Lawson moved to: (1) move Section 10 Bond Program Consent Items to immediately after Section 7 Approval of Agenda (between items 7 and 8), so the bond team could leave early; and (2) move Action Item 14.1 (Approval of Personnel Changes) to the consent calendar. Both changes were approved. As a result, the actual order was: Call to Order/Roll Call, Reconvene/Roll Call/Report Out on Closed Session, Welcome, Changes to Agenda, Approval of Agenda, Bond Program Consent Items (moved up), Oral Communication, School/Community Reports, [Bond Program Action Items - none], Discussion Items, Consent Items (including pulled-in 14.1 Personnel Changes), Action Item 14.2, Board/Superintendent Reports, Information, Correspondence, Other Business, Board Agenda Calendar, Adjournment.",
